          human: "Welcome to Diablo! Deuces are wild. You can draw a maximum of 2 cards. Here's the twist: If you open the betting and lose the hand, you must match the potâ€”doubling it for the next deal. This creates escalating pots and high-stakes tension. Only open if you have the chips and the hand!",
          ai: 'Game: Diablo (Five Card Draw Poker). Deuces (2s) are wild. Setup: 5-card deal to each player, standard antes. Gameplay: First betting round (standard poker), then draw phase (max 2 cards), then second betting round. Showdown: Best hand wins pot. Diablo rule: If the player who opened (bet first in round 1) loses the hand, they pay the pot amount into a new pot for next deal. No new antes; deal passes left. Cycle repeats until opener wins. Hand rankings include Five-of-a-Kind as highest (due to wild cards).',
